# Not ignored, and deliberately so: src/generated/ and sw/ and doc/ are checked
# in. They are generated, but a consumer of this IP must be able to build it
# without installing corsair, and the C header is what software is written
# against. Regenerate them with regs/gen_regs.py plus corsair; do not edit.
